voice "Alto"      | G4 | - | - | Ab4 | G4 | - |
voice "Tenor"     | E4 | - | - | Eb4 | D4 | - |
bass "Bass"       | C3{I} | - | - | Ab2{flat-VI} | G2{V} | - |
